WEBVTT

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:12.504
I'm not so fundamentally enthusiastic

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:16.678
Even I will participate in this

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:20.153
It's been a long time since we went for a drive

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:22.178
Everyone is excited

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:25.082
He's coming too

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.651
I may have no chance with him right now

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:32.631
But I'm definitely going

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:38.535
If you've got a good poker face

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.465
There will be something

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:45.812
Let's head to the mountains

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:48.781
We'll just get sunburned at the sea

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:53.920
Even though it's coat season

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:58.357
He is completely misunderstanding

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:02.595
What's going on?

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:06.566
Being this happy

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:14.439
I'm laughing so hard I might burst

00:01:14.808 --> 00:01:22.982
I get choked up when I see his back

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:30.889
In the whirlpool of an endless smiles

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.005
Hey!

00:03:24.904 --> 00:03:28.675
Episode 1
Farewell, Girls

00:03:28.675 --> 00:03:29.776
Episode 1
Farewell, Girls
Good morning!

00:03:29.776 --> 00:03:30.043
Good morning!

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:31.044
Good morning.

00:03:31.044 --> 00:03:32.378
You're getting up late.

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:33.746
Yeah, I know...

00:03:33.746 --> 00:03:37.443
Well, who could have slept?
Last night was awful.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.481
Huh? What do you mean?

00:03:39.652 --> 00:03:43.523
The police cars, with their sirens blaring
in the middle of the night!

00:03:43.523 --> 00:03:45.514
I didn't get any sleep.

00:03:45.592 --> 00:03:46.826
At what time?

00:03:46.826 --> 00:03:49.886
What, you didn't notice all the noise?

00:03:50.363 --> 00:03:51.464
No...

00:03:51.464 --> 00:03:52.765
I can't believe it.

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:55.635
It was after two in the morning.
It was so noisy!

00:03:55.635 --> 00:03:57.500
I didn't notice. Was it really?

00:03:57.570 --> 00:04:00.437
Yes, you should go ask the old
woman who lives downstairs.

00:04:00.673 --> 00:04:02.508
That's so strange.

00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:05.478
You usually sleep more soundly than I do, Sis.

00:04:05.478 --> 00:04:07.714
I wonder, why am I the one who
didn't notice anything?

00:04:07.714 --> 00:04:09.582
This is what I'd like to know:

00:04:09.582 --> 00:04:11.209
What time did you go to sleep last night?

00:04:12.619 --> 00:04:14.086
Last night?

00:04:16.155 --> 00:04:18.885
What time? I don't remember.

00:04:19.626 --> 00:04:22.356
Must be nice! The life of a high
school student is so carefree.

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:24.389
Well, I'm on my way.

00:04:25.031 --> 00:04:26.999
Okay, see you later.

00:04:27.834 --> 00:04:31.037
Oh, Kate, Mom and Dad said that they
would be back tomorrow night.

00:04:31.037 --> 00:04:32.171
Really?

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:33.468
See you later.

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:37.503
Last night...

00:05:02.735 --> 00:05:05.499
It doesn't really matter what
condition the body is in.

00:05:06.072 --> 00:05:07.974
It's all the same in the end,

00:05:07.974 --> 00:05:09.976
but one can't help feeling bad
when it's a girl in her teens.

00:05:09.976 --> 00:05:12.679
And there's got to be something
else going on here.

00:05:12.679 --> 00:05:15.546
This just doesn't seem like a simple suicide.

00:05:15.648 --> 00:05:17.707
I mean, there were five of them just last month.

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:20.315
Yeah, that's right.

00:05:20.887 --> 00:05:22.912
I wonder if this is just going to continue?

00:05:23.122 --> 00:05:25.283
And with the weather being so nice...

00:05:27.627 --> 00:05:29.195
Where is Alan, the superintendent?

00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:30.856
He's on-site!

00:05:31.164 --> 00:05:32.265
Where's that?

00:05:32.265 --> 00:05:35.200
Up in the mountains; there's no road.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:40.300
This way! Watch your step!

00:05:40.873 --> 00:05:42.340
I know!

00:05:42.909 --> 00:05:46.208
Why would someone go back
this far into the mountains?

00:05:46.479 --> 00:05:49.582
That's why I said to extend the tape!

00:05:49.582 --> 00:05:51.209
Don't step all over everything!

00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:53.786
The girl came all the way to a place like this?

00:05:53.786 --> 00:05:54.454
Hey, it's Claude.
The girl came all the way to a place like this?

00:05:54.454 --> 00:05:55.655
Hey, it's Claude.

00:05:55.655 --> 00:05:57.023
You mean from homicide?

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:59.292
I heard that his wife left him.

00:05:59.292 --> 00:06:00.884
The superintendent, Alan, is over there.
That would...

00:06:01.527 --> 00:06:03.154
I can hear you!

00:06:04.731 --> 00:06:06.132
What's the situation?

00:06:06.132 --> 00:06:07.429
Claude...

00:06:07.734 --> 00:06:09.702
You don't think you need to call
the homicide department?

00:06:11.137 --> 00:06:15.233
Whichever angle one looks at it from,
it looks like a suicide.

00:06:16.576 --> 00:06:17.410
But...

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:18.244
But?
But...

00:06:18.244 --> 00:06:18.811
But?

00:06:18.811 --> 00:06:21.541
The circumstances are so similar
in all the kids' cases.

00:06:22.281 --> 00:06:24.217
You mean the five kids last month?

00:06:24.217 --> 00:06:25.151
Yeah...

00:06:25.151 --> 00:06:25.985
I see.
Yeah...

00:06:25.985 --> 00:06:26.815
I see.

00:06:29.722 --> 00:06:31.883
Carrie! Carrie!

00:06:32.024 --> 00:06:33.693
Hurry! Hurry!

00:06:33.693 --> 00:06:34.026
Paul, hurry up and put your shoes on!

00:06:34.026 --> 00:06:36.396
Wendy! Wendy!
Paul, hurry up and put your shoes on!

00:06:36.396 --> 00:06:37.563
Yes...

00:06:37.563 --> 00:06:38.431
Jeez...Carrie, hurry up!

00:06:38.431 --> 00:06:39.955
Wendy!
Jeez...Carrie, hurry up!

00:06:40.299 --> 00:06:42.635
Where is Wendy?

00:06:42.635 --> 00:06:44.504
You're going to miss playtime.

00:06:44.504 --> 00:06:46.205
Wendy!

00:06:46.205 --> 00:06:48.641
Come on, hurry up.
Where did you put her?

00:06:48.641 --> 00:06:49.041
Paul!

00:06:49.041 --> 00:06:49.642
Wendy!
Paul!

00:06:49.642 --> 00:06:50.438
Wendy!

00:06:50.877 --> 00:06:51.444
Wendy!

00:06:51.444 --> 00:06:52.775
Isn't she by the TV?
Wendy!

00:06:52.912 --> 00:06:54.380
Where?

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:56.449
You were sitting there last night.

00:06:56.449 --> 00:06:57.650
Huh?

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:58.785
Over by the sofa...

00:06:58.785 --> 00:07:00.052
Wendy!

00:07:00.052 --> 00:07:01.387
Calling for her isn't going to do any good.

00:07:01.387 --> 00:07:02.221
Wendy!
Calling for her isn't going to do any good.

00:07:02.221 --> 00:07:03.017
Wendy!

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:05.517
Under the cushion!

00:07:05.625 --> 00:07:07.252
There she is!

00:07:07.527 --> 00:07:09.295
It looks like she got all dirty.

00:07:09.295 --> 00:07:12.992
She's fine; we'll take a bath together.

00:07:13.966 --> 00:07:15.661
Rose, let's go.

00:07:16.502 --> 00:07:19.130
Rose? I found Wendy.

00:07:20.973 --> 00:07:23.176
Rose? Rose?

00:07:23.176 --> 00:07:24.277
Did you fall asleep?

00:07:24.277 --> 00:07:25.111
Rose? Rose?
Did you fall asleep?

00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:26.373
Rose? Rose?

00:07:36.622 --> 00:07:38.991
It's such a pain lately.

00:07:38.991 --> 00:07:41.894
Like it matters if I'm ten or
twenty minutes late.

00:07:41.894 --> 00:07:43.963
It's always, "Be home early."

00:07:43.963 --> 00:07:46.866
Things don't even get going until after midnight.

00:07:46.866 --> 00:07:49.528
Yeah, that's the problem.

00:07:49.635 --> 00:07:52.205
Well, why don't you say that we're
studying at my house?

00:07:52.205 --> 00:07:54.298
That's a little too obvious.

00:07:54.407 --> 00:07:56.676
Yeah, like we'd actually study that much.

00:07:56.676 --> 00:07:58.940
It's not like your grades have
been getting any better.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:04.350
Well, what if we forget about going early?

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:06.752
Let's wait until our parents are
asleep and then sneak out.

00:08:06.752 --> 00:08:08.254
That's a great idea!

00:08:08.254 --> 00:08:10.656
My parents go to bed pretty early.

00:08:10.656 --> 00:08:13.960
This way, we'll get there just as
the party is really starting!

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:15.495
That's perfect!

00:08:15.495 --> 00:08:17.997
Okay, how about meeting at Club J at 1:30?

00:08:17.997 --> 00:08:18.164
Yeah!

00:08:18.164 --> 00:08:18.898
It's a plan!
Yeah!

00:08:18.898 --> 00:08:19.398
It's a plan!
Rachel, I'll be there by 1:00 too.

00:08:19.398 --> 00:08:21.100
Rachel, I'll be there by 1:00 too.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.168
Impossible.

00:08:22.168 --> 00:08:22.735
Why's that?

00:08:22.735 --> 00:08:23.169
They'll never let you in alone, Sam.
Why's that?

00:08:23.169 --> 00:08:25.404
They'll never let you in alone, Sam.

00:08:25.404 --> 00:08:26.806
What?! That's not true.

00:08:26.806 --> 00:08:29.075
Why don't you give up on Rachel?

00:08:29.075 --> 00:08:30.610
We'll tell Luke.

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:32.144
I'm not asking her out!

00:08:32.144 --> 00:08:33.611
Yeah, right!

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:36.048
Anyway, Rachel isn't interested.

00:08:36.048 --> 00:08:36.749
That's right.

00:08:36.749 --> 00:08:37.383
All I'm saying is, why don't we all go together?
That's right.

00:08:37.383 --> 00:08:39.352
All I'm saying is, why don't we all go together?

00:08:39.352 --> 00:08:40.753
What?

00:08:40.753 --> 00:08:42.054
What's wrong, Rachel?

00:08:42.054 --> 00:08:43.890
No way! What's this?

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:45.024
Huh? What's wrong?

00:08:45.024 --> 00:08:46.821
That's a strange chip.

00:09:11.317 --> 00:09:12.944
Claire?

00:09:14.787 --> 00:09:16.414
Claire?

00:09:21.027 --> 00:09:23.563
Ah! Did you just kiss me?!

00:09:23.563 --> 00:09:24.830
No, I didn't.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:29.233
What were you doing? Behave yourself!

00:09:29.402 --> 00:09:31.737
What? But I didn't do anything!

00:09:31.737 --> 00:09:33.364
Fine...

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.875
You know...

00:09:35.875 --> 00:09:40.039
Last night, you tried to call me on my
cell phone four times, didn't you?

00:09:40.212 --> 00:09:42.112
Oh, yeah...

00:09:42.448 --> 00:09:43.916
But you didn't pick up.

00:09:43.916 --> 00:09:45.084
Did you call my house too?

00:09:45.084 --> 00:09:47.552
I did, but I just got the answering machine.

00:09:49.589 --> 00:09:51.223
Was something going on?

00:09:51.223 --> 00:09:53.392
There's a shop called "Purple," right?

00:09:53.392 --> 00:09:55.528
You mean at number 38?

00:09:55.528 --> 00:09:58.264
Some girl that looks like me was
caught shoplifting there.

00:09:58.264 --> 00:10:00.700
They got it on tape.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:01.367
You didn't?

00:10:01.367 --> 00:10:01.934
Of course I didn't, idiot!
You didn't?

00:10:01.934 --> 00:10:03.836
Of course I didn't, idiot!

00:10:03.836 --> 00:10:05.805
I got caught there last year.

00:10:05.805 --> 00:10:07.500
Oh, really?

00:10:08.207 --> 00:10:10.443
That stuck-up girl and her friends
from Grace came and asked me,

00:10:10.443 --> 00:10:14.709
"Where were you last night?" and
"Did you go anywhere?"

00:10:15.314 --> 00:10:16.749
And your part-time job?

00:10:16.749 --> 00:10:18.410
I didn't go, I didn't call.

00:10:19.418 --> 00:10:22.785
If I had called, the shop owner would just have
complained, complained and complained.

00:10:23.456 --> 00:10:25.117
This really sucks.

00:10:26.359 --> 00:10:27.986
Where were you?

00:10:29.395 --> 00:10:30.862
Say, Yuan?

00:10:31.297 --> 00:10:34.734
Listen, the story is that you called
me at home around 12:00

00:10:34.734 --> 00:10:36.836
and that we talked for two hours.

00:10:36.836 --> 00:10:39.405
What? But you didn't answer the phone!

00:10:39.405 --> 00:10:42.441
Right, and that is why I want you to say so.

00:10:42.441 --> 00:10:46.434
Fine, but Claire, let me know the real story.

00:10:47.546 --> 00:10:49.173
Where were you?

00:10:49.882 --> 00:10:51.509
I don't remember.

00:10:52.852 --> 00:10:53.919
Claire, really!

00:10:53.919 --> 00:10:55.588
Really!

00:10:55.588 --> 00:11:00.423
I don't remember a thing about last night.

00:11:03.796 --> 00:11:05.064
Good morning!

00:11:05.064 --> 00:11:05.731
Morning.

00:11:05.731 --> 00:11:06.132
Good morning, Paula!
Morning.

00:11:06.132 --> 00:11:07.266
Good morning, Paula!

00:11:07.266 --> 00:11:08.134
Morning.

00:11:08.134 --> 00:11:09.965
You really need to get a haircut soon.

00:11:10.202 --> 00:11:11.103
I know!

00:11:11.103 --> 00:11:11.904
Isn't she cool?!

00:11:11.904 --> 00:11:12.271
She looked at me!
Isn't she cool?!

00:11:12.271 --> 00:11:12.972
She looked at me!

00:11:12.972 --> 00:11:14.599
Huh? Really?!

00:11:16.742 --> 00:11:18.107
Rachel...

00:11:18.544 --> 00:11:20.212
Good morning, Paula!

00:11:20.212 --> 00:11:21.577
Knock it off!

00:11:31.657 --> 00:11:32.958
Looks like you're late.

00:11:32.958 --> 00:11:35.392
Sorry, all morning, I've...

00:11:35.494 --> 00:11:36.262
Jessica?

00:11:36.262 --> 00:11:37.263
Yes!
Jessica?

00:11:37.263 --> 00:11:38.798
Rose Sheedy...

00:11:38.798 --> 00:11:41.358
You were tardy twice last month too.

00:11:42.768 --> 00:11:45.571
Here is you ticket. Don't lose it.

00:11:45.571 --> 00:11:46.939
Hurry up and get to your classroom.

00:11:46.939 --> 00:11:48.566
Yes.

00:11:52.511 --> 00:11:54.479
What can I do about it?

00:11:55.081 --> 00:11:56.248
Rose, are you all right?

00:11:56.248 --> 00:11:57.909
Sara, good morning.

00:11:58.651 --> 00:12:00.119
I got a ticket.

00:12:00.119 --> 00:12:02.519
They're so strict. Did you oversleep?

00:12:02.922 --> 00:12:04.590
This morning has been something else.

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:05.491
What do you mean?

00:12:05.491 --> 00:12:07.426
I fell asleep standing up.

00:12:07.426 --> 00:12:08.260
Really? How?

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:09.261
I have no idea.
Really? How?

00:12:09.261 --> 00:12:09.962
I have no idea.

00:12:09.962 --> 00:12:13.933
I guess my younger brother kept yelling
for me, but it didn't wake me up.

00:12:13.933 --> 00:12:15.764
Wow, that's weird.

00:12:15.968 --> 00:12:17.595
Isn't it? It's so strange.

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:21.173
Oh, by the way, I tried to call you
several times last night.

00:12:21.173 --> 00:12:21.507
Huh?

00:12:21.507 --> 00:12:22.174
Were you sleeping?
Huh?

00:12:22.174 --> 00:12:22.241
Were you sleeping?

00:12:22.241 --> 00:12:23.075
Were you sleeping?
Really? My cell?

00:12:23.075 --> 00:12:23.976
Yeah...
Really? My cell?

00:12:23.976 --> 00:12:25.944
I didn't notice.

00:12:26.979 --> 00:12:28.447
Good morning.

00:12:28.447 --> 00:12:29.744
Morning.

00:12:31.684 --> 00:12:32.451
Here you go.

00:12:32.451 --> 00:12:33.419
Thanks.
Here you go.

00:12:33.419 --> 00:12:34.249
Thanks.

00:12:37.289 --> 00:12:38.756
Thank you.

00:12:43.929 --> 00:12:48.298
I've always thought that it's so
strict for just being school.

00:12:48.834 --> 00:12:50.802
Security on the tram is really
strict too, isn't it?

00:13:12.458 --> 00:13:13.925
Morning!

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:15.561
Good morning.

00:13:15.561 --> 00:13:16.629
What's wrong?

00:13:16.629 --> 00:13:19.832
Sorry, I don't feel very well.

00:13:19.832 --> 00:13:22.802
You might as well rest a little bit.
We're already late.

00:13:22.802 --> 00:13:24.963
Besides, you're part of Grace after all.

00:13:25.037 --> 00:13:26.527
Yes.

00:13:26.639 --> 00:13:28.800
You just don't feel well? Is that all?

00:13:29.708 --> 00:13:31.972
You look different somehow.

00:13:32.812 --> 00:13:37.112
Remember, I'm counting on you.

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:39.977
I know.

00:13:41.053 --> 00:13:43.422
I'll overlook it today.

00:13:43.422 --> 00:13:45.424
Do you think you can go to class?

00:13:45.424 --> 00:13:46.891
Yes...

00:13:48.861 --> 00:13:50.496
I already told you.

00:13:50.496 --> 00:13:52.164
It's better if we go to class.

00:13:52.164 --> 00:13:54.366
Even if we did go, we're already late.

00:13:54.366 --> 00:13:56.357
I'm going to go talk to the people at work.

00:13:57.436 --> 00:13:59.238
Don't forget about our phone call last night.

00:13:59.238 --> 00:14:02.842
Fine, but I want to know the truth.

00:14:02.842 --> 00:14:05.144
Tell me what went on last night.

00:14:05.144 --> 00:14:07.346
I told you, I don't remember!

00:14:07.346 --> 00:14:09.548
How am I supposed to believe that?

00:14:09.548 --> 00:14:11.350
So, you think I'm lying?

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:14.080
Claire, come on, it's so strange.

00:14:20.993 --> 00:14:22.628
Detectives?

00:14:22.628 --> 00:14:23.562
Yeah...

00:14:23.562 --> 00:14:25.462
They're not here for you, are they?

00:14:25.798 --> 00:14:27.527
It has to do with Lise.

00:14:27.733 --> 00:14:29.360
The girl who went missing?

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:33.737
The girl who died.

00:14:48.554 --> 00:14:51.216
She was found deep in the forest.
Quite deep, actually.

00:14:52.057 --> 00:14:54.526
We're looking into this case

00:14:54.526 --> 00:14:59.088
from both the angles of suicide and homicide.

00:15:04.637 --> 00:15:08.073
I have very sad news for everyone today.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:14.035
The student from our school who went missing,
Lise, was found this morning.

00:15:15.214 --> 00:15:18.581
They said she was found dead in the middle
of the woods out in the suburbs.

00:15:19.618 --> 00:15:22.781
School is closing down for the rest of the day.

00:15:23.155 --> 00:15:26.955
Let us pray together for Lise.

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:33.465
It looks like I found a boyfriend!

00:15:33.465 --> 00:15:35.100
Really!

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:37.068
I wanted you to be the first to know.

00:15:38.537 --> 00:15:41.973
Lise...Lise...

00:16:16.809 --> 00:16:24.383
Yakusoku no
The day the promise is broken

00:16:24.383 --> 00:16:28.342
Ake no hi wa
The day the promise is broken

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:39.198
Oshiete kureru
Teaches me happiness

00:16:39.198 --> 00:16:43.294
Shiawase wo
Teaches me happiness

00:16:45.804 --> 00:16:53.445
Shizuka ni oshiete
Tell me quietly

00:16:53.445 --> 00:16:58.109
Kimi wo sagasou
I'll come looking for you

00:17:00.786 --> 00:17:08.360
Shikanai kako demo
Not so long ago

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:13.093
Kimi wo omoou
I was thinking of you

00:17:15.934 --> 00:17:23.575
Negau to chiisai
Wishing, and my only little heart

00:17:23.575 --> 00:17:28.171
Hitotsu no kokoro
Wishing, and my only little heart

00:17:30.883 --> 00:17:38.424
Kanaete, hajite mo
If it came true, I don't care about the shame

00:17:38.424 --> 00:17:43.384
Anata to itai
I want to be with you

00:17:47.733 --> 00:17:51.829
What we have to do now

00:17:52.738 --> 00:17:56.936
is get everything at our school back
to normal as soon as possible.

00:17:58.911 --> 00:18:03.439
Be careful to pay attention to students
who have changed, even just a little.

00:18:03.882 --> 00:18:05.617
Yes, Director.

00:18:05.617 --> 00:18:10.714
I want all of you from Grace to
attend the funeral, please.

00:18:10.856 --> 00:18:12.483
Yes.

00:18:12.624 --> 00:18:14.226
Kate's not here.

00:18:14.226 --> 00:18:15.557
I know.

00:18:16.562 --> 00:18:19.498
I was wandering around in the
amusement park by myself

00:18:19.498 --> 00:18:21.600
and that boy came and talked to me!

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:24.967
Even though we had just met,
we rode on the Ferris wheel together.

00:18:25.304 --> 00:18:28.034
The two of us going around and around...

00:18:43.655 --> 00:18:46.358
I guess today probably isn't
going to work out, huh?

00:18:46.358 --> 00:18:47.985
Yeah...

00:18:50.796 --> 00:18:53.458
Rachel? What's wrong?

00:19:01.773 --> 00:19:03.442
Kate?

00:19:03.442 --> 00:19:04.977
What are you doing here?

00:19:04.977 --> 00:19:07.246
It's none of your business.

00:19:07.246 --> 00:19:09.214
Did something call you out here?

00:19:09.648 --> 00:19:11.250
Just as I thought!

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.877
You too?

00:19:14.052 --> 00:19:16.788
Well, there were these butterflies.

00:19:16.788 --> 00:19:21.760
You saw them too?
Sam and Amanda didn't.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:22.828
The butterflies...

00:19:22.828 --> 00:19:23.662
Me too.
The butterflies...

00:19:23.662 --> 00:19:24.492
Me too.

00:19:24.763 --> 00:19:26.230
Who's there?

00:19:27.833 --> 00:19:29.001
Rose?

00:19:29.001 --> 00:19:32.596
I don't know, but after I noticed them,
I was drawn here.

00:19:32.971 --> 00:19:34.598
You've got to be kidding.

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:36.867
Claire!

00:19:37.876 --> 00:19:40.913
So everyone who notices them
ends up coming here?

00:19:40.913 --> 00:19:43.541
It's so creepy. What's the meaning of all this?

00:19:43.749 --> 00:19:47.452
I know it sounds weird, but do any of you...

00:19:47.452 --> 00:19:48.919
What?

00:19:49.254 --> 00:19:51.222
Remember what happened yesterday?

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:53.192
You too?!

00:19:53.192 --> 00:19:54.193
You're kidding!
You too?!

00:19:54.193 --> 00:19:55.160
You're kidding!
And you, Rose?

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:56.929
No way! Let's get out of here!

00:19:56.929 --> 00:19:59.159
Hey, let's get away from this place!

00:19:59.598 --> 00:20:01.900
Yeah, for the time being.

00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:03.527
Wait!

00:20:03.902 --> 00:20:04.803
Someone's coming.

00:20:04.803 --> 00:20:05.637
Oh my god...
Someone's coming.

00:20:05.637 --> 00:20:06.433
Oh my god...

00:20:15.948 --> 00:20:17.549
Good evening.

00:20:17.549 --> 00:20:19.176
Who?

00:20:23.488 --> 00:20:26.924
We are your teachers.

00:20:34.499 --> 00:20:36.694
About last night, do you remember?

00:20:39.071 --> 00:20:40.572
Last night...

00:20:40.572 --> 00:20:42.199
all of you...

00:20:43.642 --> 00:20:45.269
died.

00:20:54.953 --> 00:20:55.921
What are you talking about?!

00:20:55.921 --> 00:20:57.055
Just wait one minute!
What are you talking about?!

00:20:57.055 --> 00:20:58.682
Watch this.

00:21:00.058 --> 00:21:03.186
There's a man walking this way, right?

00:21:07.199 --> 00:21:10.168
You are going to use your own hands...

00:21:10.736 --> 00:21:12.533
to kill him.

00:21:14.006 --> 00:21:15.473
No way...

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:30.522
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:21:30.522 --> 00:21:32.820
One, two, everybody go!

00:21:40.932 --> 00:21:43.201
The time has come! It's now! But still!

00:21:43.201 --> 00:21:45.804
It always starts with the tears in your eyes

00:21:45.804 --> 00:21:47.906
If every weighed-out day

00:21:47.906 --> 00:21:50.108
You leave feeling sick, fly high

00:21:50.108 --> 00:21:51.677
Yesterday's failures? They don't mean a thing!

00:21:51.677 --> 00:21:53.812
Tomorrow's worries? They don't mean a thing!

00:21:53.812 --> 00:21:55.947
What's always important is this moment

00:21:55.947 --> 00:21:58.541
So it goes up to the top, top, top, top

00:22:07.059 --> 00:22:08.794
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:08.794 --> 00:22:10.195
Gather around, my comrades

00:22:10.195 --> 00:22:11.330
If the dream you haven't had doesn't fade away

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:13.098
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:13.098 --> 00:22:14.793
So don't care, babe!

00:22:14.966 --> 00:22:18.458
I'm not going to ask you the reason

00:22:18.603 --> 00:22:22.841
We'll protect you

00:22:22.841 --> 00:22:25.477
So it's okay even if they don't like you

00:22:25.477 --> 00:22:29.981
Even if they laugh at you

00:22:29.981 --> 00:22:33.018
Just keep going down that road you believe in

00:22:33.018 --> 00:22:35.620
Your tears are

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:39.891
Two of this world's treasures beyond compare

00:22:39.891 --> 00:22:42.661
I will simply keep on singing

00:22:42.661 --> 00:22:49.801
So I won't lose it and it'll reach you

00:22:49.801 --> 00:22:52.037
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:52.037 --> 00:22:54.139
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:54.139 --> 00:22:56.369
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:23:00.812 --> 00:23:03.315
The appearance of a mysterious man...

00:23:03.315 --> 00:23:05.417
The girls' screams...

00:23:05.417 --> 00:23:07.578
Left undone, this will never end.

00:23:08.120 --> 00:23:10.889
That night, a nightmarish reality began.

00:23:10.889 --> 00:23:12.524
Episode 2
A Cruel Night
That night, a nightmarish reality began.

00:23:12.524 --> 00:23:14.515
Episode 2
A Cruel Night
